    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1775860/extras/e6b41639968c14bbce7b6d5969d56520.poster.avif?t=1738693914\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1775860/extras/e6b41639968c14bbce7b6d5969d56520.webm?t=1738693914\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1775860/extras/e6b41639968c14bbce7b6d5969d56520.mp4?t=1738693914\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Now, there\u2019s another far far galaxy from a parallel universe \u2014 and suddenly the Rainbow planet appeared there for no particular reason. It had such a strong magnetic field that it practically smashed the protective barrier of the prison planet Abakaz. Many dangerous galactic criminals have managed to escape and settled in some uninhabited lands. All these unfortunate events bring us to the point where the adventures of a young hunter from planet Earth will start. <strong>It\u2019s you, of course!</strong><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1775860/extras/8528a0fad3834a3e07679222473e8543.poster.avif?t=1738693914\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1775860/extras/8528a0fad3834a3e07679222473e8543.webm?t=1738693914\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1775860/extras/8528a0fad3834a3e07679222473e8543.mp4?t=1738693914\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>So, what do we have in our digital pockets:<br><br>- Five unique planets<br>- Unicorn\u2019s head acting all bossy (gonna neigh you to death)<br>- Energy swords<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1775860/extras/2d41921895ac22695951a6e77fe35641.poster.avif?t=1738693914\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1775860/extras/2d41921895ac22695951a6e77fe35641.webm?t=1738693914\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1775860/extras/2d41921895ac22695951a6e77fe35641.mp4?t=1738693914\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>- Funny space armor that looks so familiar<br>- Procedurally generated levels<br>- Two possible endings<br>And much more (we just have a limit of six key features)<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1775860/extras/4542a914f2219d21fb0e2c7eb33c00af.poster.avif?t=1738693914\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1775860/extras/4542a914f2219d21fb0e2c7eb33c00af.webm?t=1738693914\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1775860/extras/4542a914f2219d21fb0e2c7eb33c00af.mp4?t=1738693914\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>So there you go, going to have a great time with our newest game: <strong>Space Roguelike Adventure</strong>! And yeah, we\u2019ve picked this title because it\u2019s a perfect summary of this literary-rich marketing post.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1775860/extras/d35abb2667f8b354611f2a0de28ecf1d.poster.avif?t=1738693914\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1775860/extras/d35abb2667f8b354611f2a0de28ecf1d.webm?t=1738693914\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1775860/extras/d35abb2667f8b354611f2a0de28ecf1d.mp4?t=1738693914\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
